WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Business Freedom starts by choosing who should do the change—
not by automating everything.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
onlinesourdough diagnoses Offer, Operations, and Demand.
This story selects Demand.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Resources is DIY: the method is available,
and the owner does the change.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The Fermentary is done with you:
the work and decisions are shared.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Complete Bake is done for you. Arc’IT AI appears only
as that bounded delivery in practice.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Business Freedom means fewer repeated decisions while Gustav
still chooses the route and approves publishing.
